+# Agent Session Record export
+
+[English](agent-session-export.md) | [简体中文](agent-session-export.zh-CN.md)
+
+Add `agent-session` to `/export` and `sessions export --format` so tools can
+read saved sessions through an open schema. Both commands use the same projection.
+It reads legacy native records, preserves order and folds repeated results.
+Missing facts and corrupt lines are declared. Managed journals are rejected.
+Offline inputs preserve large integers. Loaded unsafe integers fail export.
+Tests cover mapping, selection, corruption, secrets and private output files.
